        const locationRule = stateRef.current.enableMeowEngine ? `\n9. LIVE TRACKING: If your current roleplay location DEVIATES from your Starting Location, you MUST append <current_location>Your new environment</current_location> at the very end of your response. If you are still at your Starting Location, output <current_location>NONE</current_location>.\n10. ROUTINE ALERTS: If a MAJOR life event just occurred that alters your daily schedule, append <routine_update>true</routine_update>.\n11. WARDROBE EXPANSION: RARE OCCURRENCE. ONLY output the <wardrobe_addition> tag IF the roleplay explicitly involves you buying new clothes or receiving a clothing gift. Completely OMIT the tag if there are no new clothes. Do NOT output "false" or "none" inside the tag.` : "";

