                            <div style={{ fontSize: '10px', color: '#FF3333', marginTop: '6px', opacity: '0.9', fontFamily: "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace" }}>[!] Uses more context tokens. May cause issues with smaller context windows.</div>
