                                <div style={{ fontSize: '10px', color: '#FF3333', marginTop: '6px', opacity: '0.9', fontFamily: "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace" }}>[!] May cause smaller models to hallucinate titles or mixed nationalities.</div>
