                            <div style={{ fontSize: '11px', color: 'var(--text-dim)', marginTop: '4px', fontFamily: "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace", letterSpacing: '0.05em' }}>// Forcefully shreds explicit Danbooru tags right before rendering. Toggle off to rely only on AI prompting.</div>
