                        <div style={{ fontSize: '11px', color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.7)', fontFamily: "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace", lineHeight: 1.5, marginBottom: '16px' }}>
                                // <strong style={{ color: enableBeatEngine ? '#B533FF' : '#00E5FF' }}>Ace-Step Neural Audio DAW</strong>.<br /><br />
                            <span style={{ opacity: 0.85 }}>Integrates the cassette-deck music production matrix into GachaSwipe! Enables genre cartridges, 3D concept swipe decks, lyric generation, and full song stem diffusion.</span>
                        </div>

