                        <p style={{ color: 'rgba(181, 51, 255, 0.6)', fontSize: '11px', margin: '4px 0 0 0', textAlign: 'left', fontFamily: "ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace", letterSpacing: '0.05em' }}>// All your synthesized master tracks.</p>
